        "original_id": "50cd740b-2be9-5eec-a9ee-d9c3384a31d3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ian Astbury, George Thorogood, Bill Graham\n- Events: A Gathering of the Tribes\n- Products: The Dirty Dozen\n- Organizations: George Thorogood and the Destroyers\n\nFacts:\n- George Thorogood was born on February 24, 1950, and he is an American musician, singer, and songwriter from Wilmington, Delaware.\n- Ian Robert Astbury was born on May 14, 1962, and he is an English singer and songwriter.\n- A Gathering of the Tribes was a two-day music and culture festival held in California in October 1990, and it was organized by Ian Astbury and promoter Bill Graham.\n- The Dirty Dozen is the fourteenth studio album by blues rock artist George Thorogood and the Destroyers.",
